     Upon successful completion iiccoonnvv__ccaannoonniiccaalliizzee(), returns the canonical
     name of the given encoding.  If the specified name is already a canonical
     name, the same value is returned.  If the specified name is not an exist‐
     ing character encoding name, NULL is returned.

